<title>USA: Darden oks increase in stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Darden oks increase in stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Darden Restaurants Inc said on Thursday its board authorized the buyback of an additional six percent of its common.</p>
<p>This brings the total buyback authorization to 10 percent of its shares outstanding, or 15.8 million shares.</p>
<p>The board authorized the buyback after obtaining a favorable legal opinion, the company said. It did not elaborate.</p>
<p>The board also declared the regular, semi-annual dividend of $0.04 per share payable November 1, record October 10.</p>
</text>
